    "meta": "SBC News | 5 Aug 2026",
    "summary": "Adam Lamentowicz, Chief Commercial Officer CEE at Super Technologies, told SBC News that Superbet has acquired more than 250,000 customers in its first months in Greece and holds over 8% share of search three months into market entry. Greece is Superbet's sixth market launch and its first underpinned by Blackstone's €1.2bn investment; Lamentowicz called it the highest-risk commercial launch in the group's history. Superbet has signed Panathinaikos, PAOK, Levadiakos and Panionios, main sponsorship of Greek Super League 2, plus Olympiacos and AEK basketball, and is title sponsor of the Greek Cup and Super Cup.",
